  location: "청계역"
  background: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3bef652f35f44da6aa9330e3a4373ba7, type: 3}
  backgroundUv: {serializedVersion: 2, x: 0.03999999999999998, y: 0.2940625, width: 0.5, height: 0.421875}
  lines:
  - speaker: "연화"
    text: "운학 어른이 붙잡혔구나. 그날 지나간 행렬이 셋이었어."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 1
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc053e0699984d83ab4b722b88c8c24c, type: 2}
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "연화"
    text: "계곡으로는 무거운 수레가 갔어. 안에서 기침 소리가 났지. 능선에는 말을 탄 무인들이, 서쪽 다리에는 짐꾼들이 갔고."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 1
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc053e0699984d83ab4b722b88c8c24c, type: 2}
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "청운"
    text: "서로 다른 행렬이군요. 흔적을 직접 확인하겠습니다."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc053e0699984d83ab4b722b88c8c24c, type: 2}
